# CRAP Metric Hotspots

Read [`.agents/skills/complexity-lcov-join/SKILL.md`](../../skills/complexity-lcov-join/SKILL.md) before changing these files.

- Cognitive `match` is one nesting-weighted increment, not one per arm.
- Closures fold into the enclosing function; nested `fn` items are separate rows.
- Empty instrumented spans use `--missing` (default 0%). Do not treat them as 100%.
- `MatchRank` prefers forward path matches over reverse suffix length.
